==Battleground==
*1 [[Shin Godzilla]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
If leveled high enough (~40), you can easily rush this stage with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]].  [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] can replace Bullet Train Cat if timed with [[Battle Items#Sniper the Cat|Sniper the Cat]] correctly. Spawning anything will trigger Godzilla's long range attack. If you can't kill Godzilla before the animation is completed, your [[Cat Base|base]] will be destroyed. Godzilla will take up to 22 seconds to destroy the base, assuming that no units were deployed before then.

